{"hw":"εὐαρίθμητος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">εὐαρίθμητος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">εὐαρίθμητος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">easy to count</b>, i.e. <b class=\"lex-tr\">few in number</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Acut.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">40d</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">179c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ πλῆθος οὐκ εὐ. ἦν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">J.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AJ</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.15.1</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὀλίγα καὶ εὐ</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Jul.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.102c</span> </span>.</div></div>"}